+turtle.nex.outgroup.iqtree	Log-likelihood of the tree	-5352.2653	1
+turtle.lmap.outgroup.iqtree	Log-likelihood of the tree	-5377.9500	1
 turtle.nex.constr.iqtree	Log-likelihood of the tree	-5360.0758	1
